  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing Cash &amp; Voucher Assistance capacity of Mali Red Cross</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mali HQ in Bamako and selected Branches</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mali Red Cross</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Cash for WASH component will reinforce the current Chronic Crisis project in Kayes region. A specific CVA training will be done for Mali Red Cross. The CC project already includes a market assessment to evaluate whether CVA modality can be used to promote food access in the target area. This funding will complement the current activities under CC with some extra activities focused on WASH.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through training of staff (HQs and Branch) and expanding current market assessment with focus on WASH and food.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the cash readiness strategy of IFRC in Africa and enable Mali Red Cross to run CVA activities under the Chronic Crisis project in Kayes region.</narrative>
  </description>
